---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { generatorPolicy } from '../data/csp';
import '../styles/generator.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  csp={generatorPolicy}
  title="Windows answer file & Kyro profile generator | Kyro"
  description="Create Windows 11 autounattend.xml answer files and Kyro deployment profiles in your browser. Configure setup, accounts, disks and scripts without uploading your data."
>
  <div class="frame generator-page">
    <header class="generator-heading">
      <div><p class="generator-kicker">Windows answer file generator</p><h1>Your install.<br /><span>Your instructions.</span></h1></div>
      <div class="generator-heading-copy"><p>Configure Windows once. Download an answer file for your installation media, or a profile ready to import into Kyro.</p><p class="small">Windows 11 · x64 · UEFI<br />Everything you enter stays in this browser.</p></div>
    </header>
    <div id="generator-app"><p class="g-loading" role="status">Loading the generator…</p></div>
    <noscript><p class="g-callout">Enable JavaScript to generate files. All generation runs locally in your browser; no settings are submitted to a server.</p></noscript>
    <div class="generator-footnote"><p>Review the XML and test it in a virtual machine before installing on hardware. XML syntax checks do not validate an answer file against your Windows image.</p><p><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-hardware/customize/desktop/unattend/">Windows unattended setup reference</a> · <a href="https://github.com/kyro-pxe/kyro/blob/main/docs/adr/0002-profiles.md">Kyro profile format</a></p></div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import '../components/generator/mount';
</script>
